# Remotion's own headless-browser download cache — created wherever the
# render process's cwd happens to be (video-renderer/node_modules/.remotion
# is already covered by the node_modules ignore below/above; ui/.remotion
# appears because ws_run_render's render-with-progress.js subprocess runs
# with ui/ as its cwd, not video-renderer/ — see #65's sibling render-
# progress work).
.remotion/
